# The i386 row copies the whole tree into its image (docker/*.dockerfile), so
# keep out what a build does not read. `build/` matters most: it is where the
# development machine's own build trees and its MPI prefixes live, hundreds of
# megabytes of host-specific binaries that would be copied into a 32-bit image
# to be ignored.
build/
.git/
out/
*~
